[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:01.46]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:05.86]left a single note and went on their way
[00:11.50]I never got their name until the credits
[00:15.50]now it plays here every single day
[00:20.30]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:23.48]One note at a time
[00:29.30]from people passing through
[00:32.62]a name beside a line
[00:39.74]and part of it is you
[00:46.64]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
